{"id":"kenjasoncount","lines":[{"t":0.845,"end":3.845,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"(scream of pain)","de":"(Schrei vor Schmerz)","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":4.382,"end":5.682,"chars":[1],"who":"Jason","text":"(loud exhale)","de":"(lautes Ausatmen)","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":5.667,"end":11.967,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"(screaming in pain)","de":"(Schreien vor Schmerz)","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":9.05,"end":12.05,"chars":[1],"who":"Jason","text":"What number are you on?","de":"Bei welcher Zahl bist du?","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":11.986,"end":17.186,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"(559)","de":"(559)","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":16.13,"end":17.53,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"(inhale)","de":"(Einatmen)","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":16.13,"end":21,"chars":[1],"who":"Jason","text":"I wanted to fill the bucket with your blood.","de":"Ich wollte den Eimer mit deinem Blut füllen.","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":17.16,"end":20.16,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"552","de":"552","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":20.15,"end":28.05,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"(scream — soft to loud, painful... getting louder)","de":"(Schrei von leise zu laut, schmerzvoll... wird lauter)","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":23.3,"end":30.7,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"The gecko ordered me to count backwards from 1000 in sevens.","de":"Der Gecko befahl mir, von 1000 rückwärts in Siebenerschritten zu zählen.","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":30.39,"end":37.46,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"At first I didn't get why — but then it became clear.","de":"Zuerst verstand ich den Sinn nicht — doch dann wurde es klar.","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":37.76,"end":39.26,"chars":[1],"who":"Jason","text":"(exhale)","de":"(Ausatmen)","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":39.702,"end":42.702,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"500","de":"500","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":40,"end":43,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"I clung to those numbers.","de":"Ich klammerte mich an diese Zahlen fest.","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":43.96,"end":47.96,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"Meanwhile... Mr. Mori cut off my fingers.","de":"Währenddessen... trennte Herr Mori meine Finger ab.","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":48.92,"end":60,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"Again... again... and again... again... again...","de":"Wieder... wieder... und wieder... wieder... wieder...","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":55.36,"end":56.96,"chars":[0],"who":"Ken","text":"(scream of pain)","de":"(Schrei vor Schmerz)","orig":"scenes/kenjasoncount/lines/17.mp3"}]}